## Field Descriptions

### Categories

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `order` | string | `A` (ascending) or `D` (descending) |
| `sort_key` | string | `VALUE`, `LABEL`, or `COUNT` |
| `include_missing` | boolean | Include user-missing values |
| `totals.show` | boolean | Show total row/column |
| `totals.label` | string | Custom label for total |
| `totals.position` | string | `AFTER` or `BEFORE` |
| `empty` | string | `INCLUDE` or `EXCLUDE` empty categories |

### Percentages

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `show_row_pct` | boolean | Show row percentage |
| `show_col_pct` | boolean | Show column percentage |
| `show_table_pct` | boolean | Show table percentage |

### Display

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `variable_label` | string | `DEFAULT`, `NAME`, `LABEL`, `BOTH`, or `NONE` |
| `category_label_position` | string | `AUTO`, `OPPOSITE`, or `LAYER` |
| `hide_empty_categories` | boolean | Hide categories with zero counts |

### Statistics

| Field | Type | Categorical | Scalar |
|-------|------|-------------|--------|
| `count` | boolean | ✓ | ✓ |
| `mean` | boolean | - | ✓ |
| `median` | boolean | - | ✓ |
| `mode` | boolean | - | - |
| `stddev` | boolean | - | ✓ |
| `variance` | boolean | - | - |
| `min` | boolean | - | ✓ |
| `max` | boolean | - | ✓ |
| `sum` | boolean | - | - |
| `range` | boolean | - | - |
| `semean` | boolean | - | - |
| `missing` | boolean | ✓ | ✓ |
| `ptile` | number or null | - | - |

## Template Usage by Question Type

| Question Type | Template | Notes |
|---------------|----------|-------|
| Single | categorical | - |
| MultiSelect | categorical | Each checkbox is a category |
| Frequency | categorical | - |
| Rating | categorical or scalar | Use scalar for mean/median statistics |
| Matrix | categorical | Grid with double suffix |
| Ranking | categorical | Rank order variables |
| Numeric | scalar | Continuous data |

## PSPP CTABLES Mapping

### Categorical Template
```spss
CTABLES
  /TABLE=Q1 [COLPCT] BY Q2
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=Q1 ORDER=A TOTAL=YES LABEL='总计'
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=Q2 ORDER=A TOTAL=YES LABEL='总计'
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=Q1 DISPLAY=BOTH
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=Q2 DISPLAY=BOTH.
```

### Scalar Template
```spss
CTABLES
  /TABLE=S1 [MEAN MEDIAN STDDEV MIN MAX] BY Q1
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=S1 ORDER=A TOTAL=YES LABEL='合计'
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=Q1 ORDER=A TOTAL=YES LABEL='总计'
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=S1 DISPLAY=LABEL
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=Q1 DISPLAY=LABEL.
```
